      "area_altPresent_hint_fail_empty": "Say where the link leads in alt, or name it with aria-label or aria-labelledby. An <area> in a map that is in use is a link, so it can't be marked decorative.",
      "inputImage_altPresent_title": "<input type=\"image\"> must have an alt attribute",
