      "labelInName_summary_fail": "{{element}}: visible label \"{{visibleLabel}}\" (from {{labelSource}}) is not included in the accessible name (from {{nameMechanism}}).",
      "labelInName_hint_fail": "Make the accessible name contain the words of the visible label, ideally at its start, so people using speech input can activate it by saying what they see.",
